window.products.push({"id":951189,"name":"Sonaice Minky Duvet Cover for Weighted Blanket (48\" x 72\", Navy, Twin Size)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51WpvCEufXL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Polyester 【PROTECT WELL】Sonaice duvet cover would protect your weighted blanket inner from damage or leaking, which would use longer 【HOW TO CHOOSE】You choose the size of duvet cover according to your weighted blanket inner, you must choose the 48\" x 72\" duvet cover if your inner is 48\" x 72\" 【PREMIUM MATERIAL】We only use soft minky fabric, instead of the cheap polyester 【EASY CARE】Machine wash in cold water by gentle speed, dry clean, and air dry hang dry or flat dry 【EXECELLENT SERVICE】We are so confident about the quality of our Duvet Covers, we will refund your purchase if you are not satisfied. No questions asked!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51WpvCEufXL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SONAICE","source_asin":"B07Y7CPSHR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-951189","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Y7CPSHR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Y7CPSHR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":951190,"name":"Air Fryer Disposable Paper Liner, AirFryer Liners, Non-stick Parchment Paper for Frying, Baking, Cooking, Roasting, and Microwave - Unbleached, Oil-pr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61os0vvOiDL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Enjoy Easy Baking With Our AirFryer Liners I have found that parchment paper liners do prevent food from sticking to the bottom of the basket. This is especially true when cooking meats. For example, when air frying chicken wings, I have found that the meat sticks to the bottom. The result is a messy air fryer basket with chicken crusted down in the ventilation holes of the basket. In addition, if you use marinades or sticky sauces when cooking, the parchment helps reduce sticking. Second, basket liners prevent burning. Baked goods like cookies and pastries can still brown on the bottoms, and the liners are an easier and healthier alternative than greasing the basket with shortening. Finally, air fryer paper liners make cleaning easier, depending on what food you’re cooking. There will still be clean-up involved with air frying foods like meats. However, the basket liners prevent food from sticking to the basket, which does reduce scrubbing time. For some foods, like cookies or baked potatoes, the liner keeps the basket clean throughout the cooking process, requiring only a rinse after use. FEATURE: 1. Air Fryer Disposable Paper Liner with side, easy to transfer food to the plate. 2. No leaks, no spills, no mess. Keep the air fryer clean. 3. Made of premium food-grade wood pulp and nonstick coating, 100% safe for daily use. 4. Grease-proof, waterproof, and non-absorbent. 5. Heat safe up to 450 degrees F (232℃), Microwave and Oven safe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61os0vvOiDL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Autumn Coast","source_asin":"B09XTJZLP4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-951190","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XTJZLP4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XTJZLP4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
