window.products.push({"id":951213,"name":"Joyching Weighted Blanket Kids 10 lbs 48x60 inches Egyptian Cotton 600TC for Toddler Cooling Soft Heavy Throw Child Bed Size with Glass Beads, Printed","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8111PypF+zL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Transform Your Kids' Sleep: A healthy sleep routine is most important for kids. Although weighted blankets have been used to help kids with any sleep disorder, they can also be helpful for any child who needs a better night's sleep. There's nothing better than having your child wake up well-rested, refreshed, and in a great mood to start the day. If you’ve already been loving on the benefits of a weighted blanket for yourself, maybe it’s time to think about getting one for the kiddo in your life 100% Organic Egyptian Cotton: 100% Oeko-Text Certified. Egyptian cotton is a natural fiber, it does a great job in protecting your little one's skin. It's breathable, hypoallergenic and is not harsh on your baby's smooth skin. Every night children body temperature changes as children fall asleep. ... As well as keeping a child cool in the summer, cotton bedding will keep a child warm throughout winter by absorbing and retaining children body heat 100% Natural Dyes: 100% use Natural Dyes! The colors produced by natural dyes and pigments are vibrant. They are not only biodegradable but nontoxic and nonallergic too. This means that they are much better for the environment and for use around humans. But natural dyes fade when exposed to strong sunlight and also wash off easily How Does It Actually Work? The benefits of a weighted blanket are simulation Deep Touch Pressure (DTP). DTP involves the application of even pressure on the body, usually in the form of squeezing, hugging, or firm holding. Joyching weighted blanket provides the exact same feeling, placing evenly-distributed weight to produce a “grounding” effect that helps reduce anxious or stressful feelings. This natural conversion can do wonders in helping your child fall asleep faster, and stay asleep longer Hand wash, air dry or use a duvet cover. Do not machine wash, bleach, tumble dry or iron. If there is a quality problem with this weighted comforter within 30 days, we will replace it free of charge","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8111PypF+zL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Joyching","source_asin":"B08BLHKM9Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-951213","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08BLHKM9Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08BLHKM9Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
