window.products.push({"id":951284,"name":"Toaster 2 Slice 1.57\" Wide Slot with Heating Rack- Stainless Steel 2 Slice Toaster Easy to Use, Removable Crumb Tray Easy to Clean, Bagel/Defrost/Rehe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":45.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MO6t7VwxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【TOASTER 2 SLICE EASY TO CLEAN】We provide a 12 MONTH after-sales service. Please feel free to contact us if you have any question. Start Your Morning with toasters! 2 Slice toaster comes with removable crumb tray allows for quick and easy cleaning.Bagel toaster Button:toasting 1 side of your bagel or bread only. If you want to toasting both side with small toaster, just put the bread and set the time.Toaster 2 slice stainless steel save your time, you can enjoy your toast exactly you like. 【TOASTER 2 SLICE WIDE SLOT WITH FOLDABLE WARMING RACK】An Anti-sticking design, stainless steel toasters with 1.57\" wide slots can hold bagels, pancakes, waffles, English Muffins,or other thick breads. Comes with removable and stainless steel warming rack, conveniently heat croissants, donuts, cake rolls, cookie, built a simple but heartwarming \"breakfast station\" for your family with this toster. It’s a very nice bread toaster 2 slice. 【STAINLESS STEEL TOASTER EASY TO USE】The 2 slice toaster is made of SUS304 food grade stainless steel for long-term use. Compact toaster Internal use of bidirectional surround heating technology ensures toast is heated evenly.The mini toaster can stop toasting automatically when time is finished, the high lift lever will automatically pop up, which makes it easier for you to remove smaller bread.Free hands, you don’t need to keep waiting there.Breakfast becomes so much easy and delicious. 【TWO SLICE TOASTER SILVER WITH 6 BREAD SHADE SETTINGS】 This toaster 850 Watt heating system provides quick, customizable results! Simple controls that give you the setting you want. With the 6 levels time adjust to achieve temperature control,2 slice toaster wide slot meets your individual needs as you can customize different browning and crispness, from light to dark-browned bread toast. Heating tube evenly distributed, it heats fast toasts both side evenly and cool down quickly after use. 【EFFICIENT DESIGN AND EASY TO STORE】Stainless Steel Toaster with Bagel/Defrost/Reheat/Cancel Function. Cancel button:stop baking immediately without waiting for the end or turning off the power. Defrost function:which is designed for cooking frozen breakfast foods.The surface drawing process effectively prevents fingerprints from staying on the toaster. 29.52 inch power cord can be storage into the bottom of the toaster for a smaller footprint.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MO6t7VwxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TONZE","source_asin":"B094MZ41GB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-951284","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B094MZ41GB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B094MZ41GB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
