window.products.push({"id":951436,"name":"FMM Funny Faces & More Cutter Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51l9xmDR1rL._AC_.jpg","description":"Let your imagination run wild with this new Funny Faces cutter from FMM. Create hundreds of funny faces with this single cutter and decorate your cakes, cupcakes, cookies and more. The sky is the limit with this all-in-one cutter, so get creative! This pack contains one cutter that allows you to make a 60mm face shape, as well as a selection of funny features! And because of the range of designs you can produce, it's ideal for any celebration or occasion, making it an absolute must-have addition to your baking collection! The cutter can be used with various edible mediums, including: sugarpaste, modelling paste, flower paste, gumpaste, marzipan, sugarclay and more. Wash before use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51l9xmDR1rL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FMM","source_asin":"B08H8XC944","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-951436","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08H8XC944","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08H8XC944","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":951437,"name":"LG PuriCare Mini – Small Lightweight Ultra Quiet Portable Air Purifier for filtering ultra-fine dust and small particles in the Home Bedroom Office Ai","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":152.93,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RsmSC8nAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Breathe pure air wherever you go. With the LG PuriCare™ Mini Air Purifier, it's easier than ever. The LG portable air purifier is certified by the British Allergy Foundation (BAF) and is Intertek certified to filter 99% of 0.3-micron ultra-fine dust and particles.Powerful Filters: With a pre-filter and a Total Dust Care filter, our mini air purifier works to filter dust and fine particles.Whisper Quiet Operations: At just 30dB (on low), our quiet air purifier can go wherever you do, including the office or the library, without disrupting conversations or causing distractions.Long-Lasting Battery: Whether you want an air purifier for your desk at work or you need a travel air purifier that can go the extra mile, with up to 8 hours of battery life and easy USB charging, the LG PuriCare™ Mini Air Purifier can keep pace with your busy schedule.Ultra-Portable Design: Weighing just 1.2 pounds and measuring 2.72 x 7.87 x 2.52 inches, our smart air purifier fits easily into your bag—and won't take up valuable space on your desk. In fact, it's so unobtrusive that you might even forget it's there.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RsmSC8nAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LG","source_asin":"B08DK3DYM3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-951437","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08DK3DYM3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08DK3DYM3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":951438,"name":"Greenstell Laundry Hamper with Wheels, 15.3L Slim Laundry Basket with 2 Removable Liner Bags & 2 Mesh Bags, Narrow Dirty Clothes Basket, Handwoven Syn","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NFvrAHseL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Handwoven Craftsmanship - Greenstell laundry hampers with wheels are made of durable synthetic rattan materials that are waterproof, lightweight and durable. The laundry basket is made by professional craftsman, and each piece is unique, so there are subtle differences. Bright natural veneers and delicate weaving is suitable for any style of furniture design. Slim and Suitable Size - The size is 11.8 x 7.9 x 18.5 inches, which is suitable for every corner of the bedroom, bathroom, laundry room, cloakroom and so on, it is exactly expand the storage space of the room, improve the utilization rate of the small space, and make the room more tidy. Detachable and Washable Linings & Mesh Bags - Each laundry hamper is equipped with 2 liner bags with handles. The liner bags are made of high-quality stitching process and convenient to move, wash and replace. 5 mesh laundry bags make washing easier and cleaner, which are suitable for bath towels, coats, jeans, underwear, socks and so on. Light & Sturdy - The metal frame support makes the laundry basket with wheels more sturdy and durable, and the hand-made rattan weaving also makes the product stronger than the traditional fabric materials which is easy to deform and have creases. The synthetic rattan materials are lightweight and easy to carry. Easy to Assemble - Convenient tools are equipped for easy installation. Foldable laundry basket saves space and is easy to store. Offer free foot pads to replace the wheels when used on the carpet. Capacity: 15L.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NFvrAHseL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GREENSTELL","source_asin":"B09M84VY2J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-951438","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09M84VY2J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09M84VY2J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":951439,"name":"Gift Ko Elisi Christmas Parol 18 inch LED Star Capiz Lantern Philippines","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jRibR3LqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Parol is a traditional Philippine star lantern. From its most basic form of a five pointed star made of bamboo sticks and Japanese paper, the modern parol now graces a lot of Filipino homes abroad in elegant capiz shell designs. Each Gift Ko capiz parol is handcrafted by artisans in Pampanga, Philippines with skills passed on through generations. Each piece is unique and occasional scuffs and scratches on the hand-pounded capiz shell surface is normal. There may be also dents on the brass siding from hand-forming the lantern frame. All these imperfections lend to the character of each piece and do not detract from the beauty of the light display when the parol is lit. For indoor and covered outdoor use only. Because of the fragile nature of capiz shells, DO NOT USE OR DISPLAY YOUR CAPIZ PAROL IN EXTREME WEATHER CONDITIONS . We suggest displaying your parol hanging indoors in front of a window to protect it from the elements. For 2019, all Gift Ko capiz parols have been re-designed with UL listed and ICC LED components for safety, durability and hours of energy efficient enjoyment for the holiday season. Each C7 one-watt bulb has 50,000 life hours. A polarized plug with a switch is included for safety. Make sure the switch is in the OFF position before plugging your parol into the outlet. We hope you enjoy your Gift Ko parol for many Christmas seasons!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jRibR3LqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gift Ko","source_asin":"B07YSX515Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-951439","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YSX515Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YSX515Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
