window.products.push({"id":951554,"name":"Tumbler with Straw & 2 Lids by Rogue + Wolf Cute Travel Coffee Mug with Ghosts Reusable Spooky Christmas Gifts Smoothie Cup 450ml For Warm Cold Brew I","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81oe38bXeHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🖤 Design: Super cute Double Wall Insulated Tumbler with a black & white swirl reusable straw and 2 interchangeable lids: one flat and one cupcake style! The Double Acrylic Wall keeps your drinks warm or cold for longer. Decorated with adorably spooky ghosts, this magical travel coffee mug / smoothie cup is the perfect accessory to liven up (ironically) your working day! Holds 16oz / 450ml of your favourite drinks & looks so awesome you’ll want to carry it around with you everywhere! 🖤 Kinder to the Environment: Save the planet and your bank account by taking your own beverages to work with you in the Spirit Tumbler! It’s reusable which means less plastic in our Ocean and landfills & sustainable and kinder to Mother Earth. Keep yourself energised in work with a delicious mocha or keep cool n’ refreshed in summer with an iced tea, icy cold frappe or chilled smoothie! Comes with two interchangeable lids mean you can switch up the look of your tumbler as you please! 🖤 Size & Material: Generous size for real coffee & tea lovers! Holds 16 oz / 450ml of your delicious caramel frappe or peach iced tea. Or if you’re on a health kick use it for your green smoothies! Comes with 2 interchangeable lids: a flat & a cupcake style, with a super cute reusable black n’ white swirl straw! Made with BPA Free, Insulated Double Wall Acrylic, it's durable and while not dishwasher safe, it’s super easy to wash. Height 8 ¾” with cupcake lid, 6 ⅛” with flat lid. Diameter 3 ¾’’ 🖤 Superior Quality: At Rogue + Wolf, we focus on customer care and pride ourselves at producing the best quality products and keep our fans and customers happy. We spared no expense in making our tumblers, spending time in the prototype phase before manufacturing them until all details are perfect. We topped it all up with designing the most magical box to come in it, ready to gift and make the best present. The tumbler is spacious, robust and comfortable to hold due to the insulating surface 🖤 Satisfaction: We offer 90 days money back, 12 months manufacturer warranty for replacement and friendly customer service. Write to us if you encounter any issues, we will always try our hardest to help, solve any issues fast, answer your questions and above all, keep a big smile on your face","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81oe38bXeHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rogue + Wolf","source_asin":"B07L8K2S6J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-951554","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07L8K2S6J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07L8K2S6J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
