window.products.push({"id":951606,"name":"Astralign Office Chair Back Support Pillow: USA Made Thoracic Back Pillow for Back Pain & Neck Pain Relief, Back Posture Corrector Chair Pillow, Lumba","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81kpl0XZiPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MODERN POSTURE CRISIS: Many suffer Back, Neck & Shoulder pain –25 years in Physical Therapy taught me the cause is often excessive rounding of the upper spine from forward-leaning activities like driving, texting & typing while not engaging the required muscles in the midback. The Astralign gently helps the body to re-engage inactive back muscles through the technology of ACTIVE SITTING without having to wear posture braces or buzzers which can chafe delicate skin, cramp your style, or be uncomfortable! The Astralign posture corrector pillow will thus gently promote correct spinal alignment & posture. ERGONOMIC DESIGN: Quickly alleviate discomfort with the perfect Pillow Posture Corrector for men or women. This high-quality, polyfoam back pillow for car and office chair has a removable mesh cover, won’t flatten + stays cool longer than memory foam. The winged design keeps your whole torso in place rather than a lumbar roll, even while cornering in a car, to comfortably support ideal posture –No Shoulder Brace posture corrector needed Fits all body types. Small 70lbs – 110lbs, Medium 110lbs – 170lbs, Large 170lbs+ CORRECT POSTURE & PAIN: Our Portable Back Support Pillow for chair easily straps in place anywhere - Desk Chair back support, Car Seat back support for driver, seat back cushion for Air Travel, Couch Cushion support, even Backrest Pillows for bed! This Truly multi-purpose, better back posture corrector for chair can replace other neck hump corrector or upper back brace for posture correction devices, by gently reengaging dormant back muscles through ACTIVE SITTING and effectively setting the head back ‘on its axis’ so the neck & shoulders can finally relax MADE IN THE USA by CHRONIC PAIN EXPERT Richard Gleason, try our Orthopedic Back Cushion for office chair and car seat as a non-surgical solution to pain, improved posture & thoracic lumbar back support. The comfortable alternative to wearing a back brace for women or men. This back pillow for chair replaces other back, neck & shoulder supports to ease signs of poor posture; chronic headache, neck and shoulder pain, providing lower & upper back pain relief, so you can enjoy activities longer, Pain Free. RISK FREE WARRANTY: We’re so confident you’ll love the quality materials used in our Tech Neck Corrector Back Support for chair, every order comes with a one-year warranty for premature wear & tear. The Astralign Chair Back Cushion will change the way you feel when you work & play –No more being distracted by sore muscles!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81kpl0XZiPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Astralign","source_asin":"B0BG65Z1HQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-951606","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BG65Z1HQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BG65Z1HQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
