window.products.push({"id":951625,"name":"AceElite 6.75 inch Soup Spoons 6 Pieces, Japanese Miso Soup Spoon, White Asian Spoon Set, Ceramic Chinese Soup Spoons for Ramen Pho Wonton Dumpling","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51IFFTHBLkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Do you love soups? If the answer to that question is yes, then you're going to want this soup spoon. This is the perfect addition to your kitchenware. It's made of bone china and has a moderate length handle which makes it easy to get around. It also features a dull edge, making it safe for your soups and other dishes. In short, these spoons offer two functions: cooking and eating! What is AceElite Soup Spoon? AceElite is a simple and elegant ceramic spoon set that can be combined with various tableware and household items to meet your user needs and infuse new life into your life. AceElite is made of ceramic and is dishwasher safe. They are made of bone china, a high-quality lead-free, nontoxic porcelain that is shatter-resistant and harder than stoneware, and they have a long service life. It is simple and practical, making it ideal for everyday use and allowing you to have a lovely mealtime. Our AceElite soup spoon is designed in the shape of a spoon, making it easy to get around in your kitchen. These spoons also feature a dull edge, making them safe for your soups and other dishes. They are also dishwasher safe, so you can rest assured that they will always be ready for your eating and cooking needs. They are an amazing addition to any kitchenware set, and they would be perfect as a gift! What are the features of the Soupspoon? Each spoon has a length of 5.5 inches, a depth of 0.5 inches, and a breadth of 1.6 inches. It is the right length and breadth for you, Suitable for bowls 4-6 inches in diameter. The length of the spoon has been meticulously analyzed and designed to provide a comfortable grip for the user. You may be certain that we will do all in our power to prevent ceramic particles from scraping your mouth as you eat. For gifts to loved ones and friends, white porcelain is a beautiful option for any space in the home due to its clean design and neutral hue. White porcelain is also a great choice for serving dishes.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51IFFTHBLkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AceElite","source_asin":"B0B2K3WCTQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-951625","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B2K3WCTQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B2K3WCTQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
