window.products.push({"id":951827,"name":"Power Lift Chair Recliner Massage Heated Reclining Sofa Chair for Elderly Home Living Room Furniture Single Lounger Seating Electric Fabric Upholstere","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61IJMYYTPoL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This power lift recliner is incredibly sturdy and well-built. It offers a power lift function, ideal for elderly individuals who have difficulty standing from a sitting position. Not only does the soft warm fabric seat cushion and backrest provide excellent comfort and support, but the power mechanism also makes it easy to go from reclining to standing in a short amount of time with a single push of a button. This lift chair also features heating and massage functions that will soothe away your aches and pains. This beautiful fabric lift chair easily blends with your existing furnishings. Features: Fully with premium sofa fabric, this padded lift chair brings comfort Overstuffed padded cushion and backrest, offer extra comfortableness Lift mechanism pushes the chair up, help the senior stand up easily Can reach to 160 degree reclining position to meet your different requirement 2-point massage system in the waist area, 3 vibration massage modes, 3 level vibration intensity Timing function, set up running time within 10-20-30 minutes Heat function to bring comfort, the maximum heating value is 65℃ and it takes about 5 minutes to reach the maximum heating value.  Come with a functional remote control for easy to operate Side storage bag to hold your magazines and remote control in easy reach Durable material and sturdy structure, withstand up to 300 lbs Suitable for living room, bedroom, home theater, office, recreation room, etc Easy to assemble according to the instruction Specification: Color: Beige/Grey/Blue, three color to choose from  Material: Soft warm Fabric Overall dimensions: 28.3”(W) X 37” (D) X 39.4”(H) Seat Dimension: 22.8”(W) X 22”(D) Back dimensions: 20.9'' (W) X 24.8''(H) Seat height: 20'' (H) Weight capacity: 300 lbs Notice: Please check the dimension of the chair before purchasing.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61IJMYYTPoL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Danxee","source_asin":"B07ZV9ZKFV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-951827","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07ZV9ZKFV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07ZV9ZKFV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":951828,"name":"Garth Brooks Song List Incredible Mosaic Framed 8.5X11 Print Limited Edition w/COA","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Qh-kPMrYL._AC_.jpg","description":"Framed, ready for display! Approximately 9 X 11 inches This is an art print image. It has a solid background color and is made entirely of Garth Brooks song titles. The song names make up the entire image. Even the very fine lines and what looks like shading are small words. The entire song is repeated several times throughout the piece. Super cool art piece that sells for $45+ in the art shop and auction houses. This is an cool framed print by pop artist Paul Van Scott. He has made rare and unusual art pieces using poker chips, golf balls, photos, political buttons, hockey pucks, M&M Candies and playing cards to name a few. He has designed and sold mosaics for over 10 years to celebrities, athletes and museums. He's created art for covers of well known magazines, music albums and company logos. Pauls work has been featured on the Fox hit TV show \"GLEE\", college textbooks and in many news articles by outlets such as Coast To Coast AM, TMZ, The Rod Serling Foundation, Grand Illusions, Cover Magazine, Thrillist magazine and more. His \"Hank Williams Jr. bottle caps mosaic can be seen in the 2013 Matt Damon film \"Promised Land\". Very nice, limited edition piece. This is for the true collector. This listing is for a limited edition framed print directly from the artist. It is on the highest quality non-fade professional photo paper. We guarantee this to be high quality and authentic. The uniqueness of this item cannot be understood truly until you see it in person. Please view it from extremely close-up then at least 10-15 away to get the complete effect. Amazingly the farther you move it away the more detail you see. Paul has created this himself. It will NEVER be mass produced. VERY limited edition!! No more than 500 signed prints per size will EVER be released directly by the artist! You will receive a framed print along with a numbered C.O.A. that has been hand-signed by the artist.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Qh-kPMrYL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Final Score Products","source_asin":"B07DT55W59","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-951828","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DT55W59","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DT55W59","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
