window.products.push({"id":951910,"name":"Juicer, Juicer Machines Easy to Clean, 3\" Feed Chute Juicer Extractor for Whole Vegetable and Fruit, 2 Speeds Control for Soft & Hard Fruits, With Bru","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":45.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61w3hS1+M9L._AC_SL1497_.jpg","description":"【Enjoy Juice in Seconds】This centrifugal juicer works with an industry-leading powerful turbo motor with food-grade sharp blades, making efficiency 20% faster than before. 【More Nutrition & Less Wasting】Mesh filter ensures nutrients from all parts of fruits and vegetables get into juice while minimizing pulp, filtering seeds, and separating foam. Squeezes more than 30% juice and 40% vitamins & minerals in seconds. Less depletion technology brings highly concentrated fresh juice and delivers cleaner output. 【No Pre-cutting XXL Feed Chute】3\" Feed Chute juicer machines for whole vegetables and fruit. Thanks to the extra-large filling shaft, you can pour lots of fruit and vegetables directly into the juicer. Less precutting, and more continuous juicing for fresh fruit juice, vegetable juice, or nutrient-packed celery juice. 【Customize Your Juicing】Explore more possibilities of juice by two speeds custom settings for easy extraction of maximum juice from fruit and vegetable. Speed \"I\" (12,000 RPM to 15,000 RPM) for \"soft\" types: celery, watermelon, orange, etc. Speed \"Ⅱ\"(15,000 RPM to 18,000 RPM) for \"hard\" types: apples, carrots, etc. The juicer machines can perfectly separate juice and pulp, making a variety of healthy juices for your family. 【Proven Safety Features】Built-in safety features like Overheat Protection, auto-off and more to keep your mind at ease. Non-slip rubber feet keep juicer machine from vibrating. Safety lock ensures safe and reliable use. Durable materials: Polymer plastic structure, large pulp collector and cleaning brush. All parts are BPA-free material. 【Easy Clean-up】all removable parts are dishwasher-safe, Making cleaning easier and faster with the included brush. 【Built-in Froth Separator】Certain fruits or vegetables create froth when juiced; The juice jug features an integrated froth separator to pour more juice, less froth into the juice cup. 【Compact But Suitable Capacity】The Juice Jug and 2L Pulp Container fit enough food for 2-4 people, with compact design takes up little room on your countertop 【Anti-drip Function】Design with anti-drip function, no need to worry about juice spilling everywhere. 【Attention】Before using the juicer extractor for the first time, please remove all plastic protective films and card, not recommend using bananas, mangoes, grapes and other low juicing rate for juicing.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61w3hS1+M9L._AC_SL1497_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Juilist","source_asin":"B09XB89Q7P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-951910","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XB89Q7P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XB89Q7P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":951911,"name":"Delta Children - Batman Twin Furniture Set, 3-Piece by DC Comics (Batman Upholstered Twin Bed | Storage Unit with 6 Cubby's and Batman Bins | Batman A","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91ctv8AozjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The DC Comics Batman 3-Piece Twin Furniture Set adds action-packed style to any caped crusader’s bedroom. This set includes an Upholstered Twin Bed, 6 Cubby Deluxe Storage Unit and Area Rug, Batman. UPHOLSTERED TWIN BED: Even superheroes need a comfy place to sleep— Bed by Delta Children features a headboard and footboard adorned with the Bat logo, graphics of the Gotham City skyline and 3D applique of Batman’s silhouette. Constructed with a sturdy wood frame and upholstered in a faux leather fabric to create a cozy and secure sleep space for your little vigilante. BATMAN 6 CUBBY DELUXE STORAGE UNIT: from Delta Children - keeps toys, books, games, or accessories organized. The unit features a sturdy wood frame that features 6 open cubbies and includes three bonus storage bins printed with Batman graphics. Perfect as storage in the bedroom, playroom, living area—pretty much anywhere. BATMAN AREA RUG: with Non-Slip Backing from Delta Children. Showcasing the iconic Bat symbol in bold shades of yellow and black, this accent rug is the perfect choice. A super-cool addition to any kids’ bedroom, man cave or hang out spot, it features a soft, plush pile that makes it comfy to play on, sit on or walk on. Made from durable materials, it can withstand everyday wear and tear, so it's a great option for high-traffic areas around the house. Plus, there’s no need for a rug pad, this rug’s non-slip backing ensures it always stays in place. About Batman: Dark Knight. Caped Crusader. Sworn protector of Gotham City. Batman goes by many names, but he has only one mission—become the world’s greatest weapon against crime. His powers? Super-sophisticated gear and intelligence. Batman’s utility belt and Batmoblie help him morph into the ultimate vigilante. Made to KA-POW, Batman furniture and home decor from Delta Children add cool style to your any space while creating a fun crime-fighting ambiance that's perfect for pretend play.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91ctv8AozjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Delta Children","source_asin":"B07CQB8928","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-951911","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CQB8928","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CQB8928","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
